/-!
# A230001

Triangular array read by rows: row n shows the coefficients of the polynomial v(n) = d(0) + d(1)*x + ... + d(k)*x^k which is the denominator of the n-th convergent of the continued fraction [1, 1/x, 1/x^2, ... ,1/x^n].

The 86 terms known to OEIS, indexed from `0`.

Skeleton generated by `lake exe oeis-gen`; every declaration is a `sorry` placeholder.
-/

namespace A230001

